# UndefinedBehaviorSanitizer suppressions.
#
# One entry per line: <check>:<pattern>, the pattern matching a function
# name, a source file or a library where the check fails. A suppressed
# report is neither printed nor counted by halt_on_error.

# lzham, the codec of the .brs meshes, under thirdparty/: on x86 it reads
# its bit stream and its match buffers with unaligned integer loads, on
# purpose (LZHAM_USE_UNALIGNED_INT_LOADS), and its vector copies an empty
# vector with memcpy(nullptr, nullptr, 0). Both are harmless on the
# platforms it is built for, and it is not our code to rewrite.
alignment:lzham_codec
nonnull-attribute:lzham_codec
